WEBVTT

NOTE Web version: narration as subtitles. Timing follows the transcript panels.

00:08.300 --> 00:13.100
In the 1970s, a young Raúl
does not meet the young José Vicente,

00:14.300 --> 00:17.900
he returns to the United States
and later goes to France,

00:18.400 --> 00:23.200
where he stays for many years, becoming
professor emeritus at the École Normale Supérieure,

00:24.500 --> 00:29.200
and is recognised as one of the
most important seismologists in the world.
